WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:03.601
-Well, it's been a big
24 hours

00:00:03.601 --> 00:00:06.133
for investigations into
Donald Trump and his associates.

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:09.534
The committee probing the
January 6th insurrection

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:11.501
subpoenaed several
key Trump allies,

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:13.634
including his former
personal attorney

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:15.334
and the New York
attorney general

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:16.734
revealed in court documents

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:19.534
that her office had uncovered
evidence of possible fraud

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:20.934
committed by Trump's businesses.

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:23.033
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:26.601
♪♪

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:28.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:30.834
There were lots of little
known functionaries involved

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:33.133
in Trump's attempted coup,
whose names you might

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:35.000
not remember,
guys like John Eastman,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.534
who wrote the memo laying out
how to overturn the election,

00:00:37.534 --> 00:00:39.801
or Jeffrey Clark,
who tried to seize control

00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:41.100
of the Justice Department

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.300
and announce that there
was fraud in the election.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.267
You don't have to know
their names

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:47.567
to just know these two guys
look like henchmen.

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:49.534
They're the types of guys
you expect

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:52.167
to see playing boar
on the floor with Logan Roy.

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:53.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:54.667
I'm shocked.

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:56.334
I'm shocked we didn't see
Cousin Greg

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:58.334
at one of Trump's
press conferences.

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:00.400
"Uh, sir, if I may.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.801
Your eminence, uh,
Tom instructed me

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:06.000
that in no uncertain terms
that, uh, we were not

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.501
to promulgate any known
falsehoods on television,

00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:13.501
or he would make me
eat, uh,

00:01:13.501 --> 00:01:16.634
eat a big bucket of [bleep]."

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:18.100
Look at Greg.

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.267
Greg is all grown up.

00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:25.200
The time's gonna get there.
The time's gonna get there.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.534
That's -- that's what it takes
for a plan like this

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:30.000
to come as close
to succeeding

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.567
as it did a bunch of lesser
known functionaries

00:01:32.567 --> 00:01:34.701
who will help execute
the plan below the radar.

00:01:34.701 --> 00:01:38.100
For example, you might remember
this bashful little wallflower

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.033
who conquered his fear
of public speaking

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.567
so he could appear
at a few press conferences

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:44.801
after the 2020 election
on Trump's behalf.

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:47.634
-♪ Macho, macho man ♪

00:01:47.634 --> 00:01:50.234
-Let's have trial by combat.

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:52.133
That could have
been Mickey Mouse,

00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:53.634
that could have been
a dead person.

00:01:53.634 --> 00:01:56.601
Do you think we're stupid?
You think we're fools?

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:59.100
Did you all watch
"My Cousin Vinny?"

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.300
You know the movie?

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.267
-Rudy Giuliani was caught using

00:02:02.267 --> 00:02:04.834
an electric shaver,
okay,

00:02:04.834 --> 00:02:06.501
out in public
at the airport.

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:07.934
But here's the thing.

00:02:07.934 --> 00:02:10.901
He was sitting at the table
eating while he did it.

00:02:10.901 --> 00:02:13.334
-First, he had lobster bisque.

00:02:13.334 --> 00:02:15.367
Then he began grooming.

00:02:15.367 --> 00:02:17.200
-He says to her
how many fingers do I --

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.834
"How many fingers do I got up?"

00:02:18.834 --> 00:02:25.167
Virginia vote against the man
who dishonored our past

00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:27.167
by selling my bedroom.

00:02:27.167 --> 00:02:29.033
With a very big spike
in the vote count

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:32.400
at exactly that time,
right up.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.968
I assume Milwaukee
and also in Madison,

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:37.968
voters in a district vote.

00:02:37.968 --> 00:02:40.667
We don't have that
kind of subpoena power.

00:02:40.667 --> 00:02:42.334
They don't decide the election.

00:02:42.334 --> 00:02:45.334
The call for Joe Biden,
isn't --

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:46.334
Who was it called by?

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:49.467
All of then.
Oh, my goodness.

00:02:49.467 --> 00:02:51.200
All the networks.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.801
Wow.

00:02:53.801 --> 00:02:55.434
All the networks.

00:02:55.434 --> 00:02:59.267
-He looked like he just escaped
from Shawshank Prison.

00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:02.000
Of course
Rudy would probably crawl

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.267
into a random drainage pipe
and end up in prison.

00:03:05.267 --> 00:03:06.634
-"Whoa. Whoa, whoa.

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:09.634
A warm bed and a toilet
and the Rita Hayworth post?

00:03:09.634 --> 00:03:12.400
How lucky can one guy get?"

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.834
As much as we play those clips,
I'll never get over the fact

00:03:14.834 --> 00:03:17.100
that that guy
who sounds like the guy

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.968
who sprays the shoes
at the bowling alley --

00:03:19.968 --> 00:03:24.601
"One for you,
and one for Rudy" --

00:03:24.601 --> 00:03:27.133
that guy was once crowned
America's mayor

00:03:27.133 --> 00:03:29.701
on magazine covers and became
the personal attorney

00:03:29.701 --> 00:03:31.133
to the president
of the United States.

00:03:31.133 --> 00:03:33.400
Rudy is what happens
when a scientist

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.901
accidentally places
the DNA of a fruit bat,

00:03:35.901 --> 00:03:38.934
Mr. Bean,
and yet somehow he ended up

00:03:38.934 --> 00:03:40.834
working for the most powerful
person in the world.

00:03:40.834 --> 00:03:42.534
You imagine in your head
that the president

00:03:42.534 --> 00:03:45.067
has all this power and
information at their fingertips.

00:03:45.067 --> 00:03:47.133
They have 17 different
intelligence agencies,

00:03:47.133 --> 00:03:48.434
the White House
Situation Room,

00:03:48.434 --> 00:03:50.734
an army of government lawyers
and some of the richest,

00:03:50.734 --> 00:03:52.501
most powerful people
in the world on their side.

00:03:52.501 --> 00:03:54.801
And yet, Trump ended up
with a mole man

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:57.868
who sweats like
he's the defendant.

00:03:57.868 --> 00:04:00.300
Rudy sweats like
he's working the pizza oven

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:03.167
in a Spike Lee movie,

00:04:03.167 --> 00:04:04.968
Trump told the guy
to hold a press conference

00:04:04.968 --> 00:04:06.834
at the Four Seasons Hotel,
and he ended up

00:04:06.834 --> 00:04:08.534
at the Four Seasons
landscaping company.

00:04:08.534 --> 00:04:12.968
As a career comedy writer,
I got to tip my hat.

00:04:12.968 --> 00:04:15.334
I mean, thank God, I never tried
to find any fraud in Vermont.

00:04:15.334 --> 00:04:17.567
He would have ended up at
the Burlington Coat Factory.

00:04:17.567 --> 00:04:18.868
"Wait a second.

00:04:18.868 --> 00:04:21.033
Those aren't voters.
Voters have heads and limbs.

00:04:21.033 --> 00:04:23.968
Oh, Rudy,
you've done it again."

00:04:23.968 --> 00:04:25.334
Also, I would just like
to circle back

00:04:25.334 --> 00:04:26.601
and emphasize once again

00:04:26.601 --> 00:04:29.000
that this man is terrible
at impressions.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.534
-One time Bill Clinton asked me,
"What's this guy Romney like?"

00:04:32.534 --> 00:04:34.567
You know what I told them?
He's our Al Gore.

00:04:36.534 --> 00:04:37.934
-All right, Rudy.
-Mueller's saying,

00:04:37.934 --> 00:04:39.200
obstruction of justice.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.901
You cut to him,
obstruction of justice,

00:04:40.901 --> 00:04:43.434
which the guy will say,
"Say obstruction of justice."

00:04:43.434 --> 00:04:44.501
Obstruction of justice.

00:04:44.501 --> 00:04:47.133
I told this to
the Queen of England.

00:04:47.133 --> 00:04:48.767
She said, "You did --

00:04:48.767 --> 00:04:52.901
you did a wonderful
job on September 11."

00:04:52.901 --> 00:04:54.267
"How many fingers do I got up?"

00:04:54.267 --> 00:04:58.434
-I'm Spartacus.
-By the way, Biden has been...

00:04:58.434 --> 00:05:01.334
-Man, this "SNL" audition sucks.

00:05:01.334 --> 00:05:03.834
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.834 --> 00:05:06.167
If Lorne ever saw impressions
that bad,

00:05:06.167 --> 00:05:08.467
he'd probably say,
well, he could do "Update."

00:05:08.467 --> 00:05:11.601
[ Laughter ]

00:05:11.601 --> 00:05:13.734
Thank you.

00:05:13.734 --> 00:05:16.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:16.701 --> 00:05:18.000
Was that 50 years ago?

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.100
Jesus.

00:05:20.834 --> 00:05:23.334
[ Laughter ]

00:05:23.334 --> 00:05:24.901
Rudy's impression of the Queen

00:05:24.901 --> 00:05:27.267
sounds exactly like
his impression of Joe Pesci,

00:05:27.267 --> 00:05:29.667
which sounds exactly like
his impression of Kirk Douglas,

00:05:29.667 --> 00:05:31.868
at least I think he's doing
a Kirk Douglas impression

00:05:31.868 --> 00:05:33.200
judging from his voice.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:35.501
Maybe Rudy thinks Al Pacino
played Spartacus.

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:37.934
"I'm Spartacus.
Your Spartacus.

00:05:37.934 --> 00:05:42.100
This whole damn Colosseum
is Spartacus."

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.434
How was that Lorne?

00:05:43.434 --> 00:05:45.300
[ Laughter ]

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.834
Anyway, why do they bring up
Rudy Giuliani?

00:05:47.834 --> 00:05:50.467
Oh, right. You guys are not
going to believe this.

00:05:50.467 --> 00:05:51.868
He got subpoenaed.

00:05:51.868 --> 00:05:53.100
-We have this breaking
news for you now.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.133
The House Select Committee
investigating

00:05:55.133 --> 00:05:57.801
the January 6th Capitol
insurrection has just

00:05:57.801 --> 00:05:59.801
subpoenaed four close allies

00:05:59.801 --> 00:06:02.200
of Donald Trump,
including Rudy Giuliani.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.901
-These subpoenas now,
they mark

00:06:03.901 --> 00:06:06.534
a significant escalation
by this committee,

00:06:06.534 --> 00:06:10.000
especially because they're
going after Rudy Giuliani.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.701
Rudy Giuliani now,
of course,

00:06:11.701 --> 00:06:13.634
he worked closely
with Trump for years,

00:06:13.634 --> 00:06:15.767
and he was leading the effort

00:06:15.767 --> 00:06:17.934
to overturn
the 2020 election results.

00:06:17.934 --> 00:06:20.467
Of course, he spearheaded
several lawsuits

00:06:20.467 --> 00:06:23.033
that were dismissed
in several different courts,

00:06:23.033 --> 00:06:25.334
and Giuliani notably
also spoke out at that

00:06:25.334 --> 00:06:27.701
Stop the Steal
rally on January 6th.

00:06:27.701 --> 00:06:30.234
He called for "trial
by combat,"

00:06:30.234 --> 00:06:32.634
so he in particular
has a lot of information

00:06:32.634 --> 00:06:34.300
the committee
wants to dig into.

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:35.968
-Oh no, if you're Rudy Giuliani,

00:06:35.968 --> 00:06:38.067
you never want to hear
the words dig into.

00:06:38.067 --> 00:06:39.834
He's probably having flashbacks

00:06:39.834 --> 00:06:41.601
the last time he was
at Ruby Tuesday.

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:44.367
"Hey, will you stop digging
in the salad bar.

00:06:44.367 --> 00:06:46.000
It's for paying customers only."

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.767
"What?" I thought
it was free for people

00:06:47.767 --> 00:06:49.200
named Ruby on Tuesdays."

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.968
-"But your name is Rudy."

00:06:50.968 --> 00:06:52.834
"Oh, Ruby.

00:06:52.834 --> 00:06:54.968
[ Laughter ]

00:06:54.968 --> 00:06:57.133
You did it again."

00:06:57.133 --> 00:06:58.634
[ Laughter ]

00:06:58.634 --> 00:06:59.968
I mean, it's starting
to get ridiculous.

00:06:59.968 --> 00:07:02.033
How much legal trouble
can one person be in?

00:07:02.033 --> 00:07:04.067
Is Rudy trying to break
the world record?

00:07:04.067 --> 00:07:05.868
He's under investigation
by the feds,

00:07:05.868 --> 00:07:09.100
he was raided by the FBI,
he's been sued by poll workers

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:10.834
and an election
technology company.

00:07:10.834 --> 00:07:13.901
His law license was suspended
in New York and D.C.,

00:07:13.901 --> 00:07:15.000
and now he's being subpoenaed.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.567
Next, he's going
to get pulled over

00:07:16.567 --> 00:07:19.667
for swerving only to blow
a zero on the breathalyzer.

00:07:19.667 --> 00:07:21.601
"Oh, that's very weird.

00:07:21.601 --> 00:07:23.334
I thought for sure
you were driving drunk."

00:07:23.334 --> 00:07:24.667
"Well, I have
to be pretty stupid

00:07:24.667 --> 00:07:27.634
to get a drunk driving
before driving a stolen car."

00:07:27.634 --> 00:07:29.734
♪♪

00:07:29.734 --> 00:07:32.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:32.234 --> 00:07:35.033
As for the -- [ Laughs ]

00:07:35.033 --> 00:07:37.601
As for the actual content
of what really might reveal

00:07:37.601 --> 00:07:38.834
to the committee
if he cooperates,

00:07:38.834 --> 00:07:40.067
there's a lot we can learn.

00:07:40.067 --> 00:07:42.200
After all, he was instrumental
in leading

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.968
Trump's effort
to overturn the election.

00:07:43.968 --> 00:07:45.601
He spoke at those
press conferences

00:07:45.601 --> 00:07:48.033
and the Stop the Steal
rally on January 6th,

00:07:48.033 --> 00:07:49.968
where he called
for "trial by combat."

00:07:49.968 --> 00:07:52.100
He personally called up
lawmakers

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:54.400
like Alabama Senator
Tommy Tuberville

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.968
on the day of the insurrection
to get them to delay

00:07:56.968 --> 00:07:58.400
the counting
of electoral votes,

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:00.868
and he helped set up
a command center

00:08:00.868 --> 00:08:03.667
in a D.C. hotel with other
Trump allies like Steve Bannon.

00:08:03.667 --> 00:08:06.000
I personally can't wait
to see him under oath

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.868
because we know from experience
he's not exactly great

00:08:08.868 --> 00:08:10.367
when he's giving
sworn testimony.

00:08:10.367 --> 00:08:12.701
For example, we have
a videotaped deposition

00:08:12.701 --> 00:08:15.934
from a defamation lawsuit filed
by election technology firms

00:08:15.934 --> 00:08:17.667
where Rudy straight up admitted

00:08:17.667 --> 00:08:19.968
he made public accusations
without any proof.

00:08:19.968 --> 00:08:27.601
-We had a report that the heads
of Dominion and Smartmatic

00:08:27.601 --> 00:08:30.234
somewhere in the mid teens,

00:08:30.234 --> 00:08:36.601
you know, 2013, 2014,
went down to Venezuela

00:08:36.601 --> 00:08:39.434
for a get-to-know
meeting with Maduro

00:08:39.434 --> 00:08:42.434
so they could demonstrate
to Maduro

00:08:42.434 --> 00:08:45.868
the kind of vote fixing
they did for--

00:08:45.868 --> 00:08:50.200
for, um, for Chavez.

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:53.033
-You say the heads
of Dominion and Smartmatic?

00:08:53.033 --> 00:08:54.467
-Yes, that's what I was told.

00:08:54.467 --> 00:08:59.067
Before the press conference,

00:08:59.067 --> 00:09:00.567
I was told about it.

00:09:00.567 --> 00:09:04.601
Sometimes I go and look myself
online when stuff comes up.

00:09:04.601 --> 00:09:06.133
This time I don't have
the time to do it.

00:09:06.133 --> 00:09:10.200
It's not my job in
a fast-moving case

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:12.167
to go out and investigate
every piece

00:09:12.167 --> 00:09:13.267
of evidence that's given to me.

00:09:13.267 --> 00:09:16.834
-No, that is your job.

00:09:16.834 --> 00:09:18.467
When you passed
the New York bar,

00:09:18.467 --> 00:09:20.934
was it O'Hallaghans?

00:09:20.934 --> 00:09:22.501
You're a lawyer,
you have to prove

00:09:22.501 --> 00:09:23.801
what you say in court.

00:09:23.801 --> 00:09:26.234
You don't even learn that
in year one of law school.

00:09:26.234 --> 00:09:29.133
You learn it and act one
of "My Cousin Vinny."

00:09:29.133 --> 00:09:31.033
Of course, you probably
hated that movie.

00:09:31.033 --> 00:09:32.067
"What is this crap?

00:09:32.067 --> 00:09:34.100
Vinny doesn't marry the cousin?"

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:36.434
[ Laughter ]

00:09:38.767 --> 00:09:40.167
But this is how it always goes.

00:09:40.167 --> 00:09:42.601
These morons make a bunch
of crazy allegations in public,

00:09:42.601 --> 00:09:45.300
and then in private when
there are actual consequences,

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:46.467
they admit they're
full of [bleep].

00:09:46.467 --> 00:09:48.501
Like, when the Trump campaign
wrote a memo

00:09:48.501 --> 00:09:50.534
in private debunking
its own fraud claims,

00:09:50.534 --> 00:09:53.534
or when Rudy told the court,
this is not a fraud case.

00:09:53.534 --> 00:09:55.000
In fact, you know what
I'd love to see?

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.267
I'd love to see the public
Rudy Giuliani

00:09:57.267 --> 00:09:59.300
that appears in press
conferences cross-examine

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:02.067
the private Rudy Giuliani
we see in depositions.

00:10:02.067 --> 00:10:03.601
-How many fingers do I got up?

00:10:03.601 --> 00:10:06.200
Somewhere in the mid teens,

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:10.734
you know, 20, 13, 14,
whatever.

00:10:10.734 --> 00:10:12.267
-And yet somehow lucky for him,

00:10:12.267 --> 00:10:15.067
Rudy Giuliani is still not in
as much legal trouble

00:10:15.067 --> 00:10:16.467
as his former client,
Donald Trump,

00:10:16.467 --> 00:10:18.400
who is under multiple
investigations in multiple

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:20.434
states and jurisdictions
examining everything

00:10:20.434 --> 00:10:22.300
from the coup attempt
to his private business.

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.133
And now the New York
attorney general

00:10:24.133 --> 00:10:26.267
has taken one of those
investigations a step further

00:10:26.267 --> 00:10:27.734
by releasing public details

00:10:27.734 --> 00:10:29.801
of what her investigation
has uncovered so far,

00:10:29.801 --> 00:10:32.934
and it's both incredibly damning
and not at all surprising.

00:10:32.934 --> 00:10:35.234
-Breaking overnight, New York
State's attorney general

00:10:35.234 --> 00:10:37.801
is demanding answers
in her investigation

00:10:37.801 --> 00:10:39.467
of the Trump Organization.

00:10:39.467 --> 00:10:41.234
Letitia James filed court papers

00:10:41.234 --> 00:10:43.234
requesting former
President Trump,

00:10:43.234 --> 00:10:45.834
his son Donald Jr.
and daughter Ivanka Trump

00:10:45.834 --> 00:10:47.868
to be questioned under oath.

00:10:47.868 --> 00:10:50.100
James laid out some of the
evidence against the company

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.567
and says that Trump's need
to respond to this.

00:10:52.567 --> 00:10:54.734
-What we are learning
from this filing

00:10:54.734 --> 00:10:59.567
in this press release tonight
is that the -- the allegations

00:10:59.567 --> 00:11:03.234
are that Donald Trump,
Donald Trump Jr.

00:11:03.234 --> 00:11:09.534
and Ivanka Trump were
very involved in exaggerating

00:11:09.534 --> 00:11:13.934
or misstating statements
of assets and finances

00:11:13.934 --> 00:11:19.968
in order to obtain loans,
insurance and tax credits

00:11:19.968 --> 00:11:24.400
and to over inflate the value
of various properties.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:26.267
-You know how when people
are shocked

00:11:26.267 --> 00:11:27.634
they spit out their water?

00:11:27.634 --> 00:11:29.901
When I heard Donald Trump
exaggerated the value

00:11:29.901 --> 00:11:32.000
of his assets
for the purposes of lying

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.334
to banks and the IRS,

00:11:33.334 --> 00:11:36.033
it was so the reverse
of shocking.

00:11:36.033 --> 00:11:38.501
I sucked the water
back into my mouth.

00:11:38.501 --> 00:11:40.467
[ Laughter ]

00:11:40.467 --> 00:11:41.701
We even filmed it.

00:11:43.601 --> 00:11:46.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:57.734 --> 00:12:00.100
[ Laughter ]

00:12:04.567 --> 00:12:07.534
We did that together.

00:12:07.534 --> 00:12:11.200
I mean, of course,
this guy committed fraud.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.200
His business and former CFO

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:14.734
have already been charged
with tax crimes.

00:12:14.734 --> 00:12:17.634
Trump himself paid no income
taxes in 10 out of 15 years,

00:12:17.634 --> 00:12:18.968
according to
the New York Times.

00:12:18.968 --> 00:12:21.501
He lost a billion dollars
over a decade,

00:12:21.501 --> 00:12:25.968
and in 2016 and 2017,
he paid $750 in income taxes.

00:12:25.968 --> 00:12:29.834
He paid less in federal
income taxes for an entire year

00:12:29.834 --> 00:12:31.934
while he was president
of the United States

00:12:31.934 --> 00:12:33.434
than what I paid in rent

00:12:33.434 --> 00:12:35.300
for my first apartment
in New York City.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:39.033
Of course, you have to remember
I moved here in 1851.

00:12:39.033 --> 00:12:41.133
It was a studio
and the only entrance

00:12:41.133 --> 00:12:42.400
was a third story window

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.501
you had to climb
through via ladder

00:12:44.501 --> 00:12:47.367
from the smallpox
asylum next door.

00:12:47.367 --> 00:12:48.701
It was a small fridge.

00:12:48.701 --> 00:12:50.767
Inside the fridge, there was an
even smaller futon.

00:12:50.767 --> 00:12:52.634
It was so cold
sleeping in there.

00:12:52.634 --> 00:12:54.334
But if you left the door
open for heat,

00:12:54.334 --> 00:12:56.367
the light stayed on, so...

00:12:56.367 --> 00:12:58.601
Who was the landlord
of that [bleep] anyway?

00:12:58.601 --> 00:12:59.801
Ah, [bleep]!

00:12:59.801 --> 00:13:01.467
[ Laughter ]

00:13:01.467 --> 00:13:03.000
The details published
in this court filing

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.501
are also in typical
Trump fashion,

00:13:04.501 --> 00:13:08.734
both deeply corrupt and also
not even remotely surprising.

00:13:08.734 --> 00:13:10.968
-In court documents
filed late Tuesday,

00:13:10.968 --> 00:13:13.801
New York State's Attorney
General Letitia James

00:13:13.801 --> 00:13:16.801
said her investigators found
the Trump Organization

00:13:16.801 --> 00:13:20.434
repeatedly engaged in fraudulent
or misleading practices.

00:13:20.434 --> 00:13:23.534
She cited multiple cases
where the former president

00:13:23.534 --> 00:13:25.567
lent his signature
on documents

00:13:25.567 --> 00:13:28.501
where she says he inflated
the value of his company

00:13:28.501 --> 00:13:29.968
and his own fortune.

00:13:29.968 --> 00:13:31.968
James highlighted
several accounts

00:13:31.968 --> 00:13:35.200
of how she says the company
inflated its bottom line,

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:38.601
including misrepresenting the
size of Mr. Trump's penthouse,

00:13:38.601 --> 00:13:41.033
saying it was triple
its actual size,

00:13:41.033 --> 00:13:44.267
leading to a difference
of about $200 million.

00:13:44.267 --> 00:13:47.334
In another example,
James says Mr. Trump's company

00:13:47.334 --> 00:13:49.801
inflated the value
of his suburban golf club

00:13:49.801 --> 00:13:51.234
by millions of dollars

00:13:51.234 --> 00:13:53.734
by counting fees
that were never collected.

00:13:53.734 --> 00:13:56.234
-Well, of course, he inflated
the value of his golf club.

00:13:56.234 --> 00:13:58.100
Remember that picture of Trump
at the omelette bar?

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.267
It's different place,
but does that look like

00:14:00.267 --> 00:14:02.868
a multimillion dollar
property to you?

00:14:02.868 --> 00:14:05.467
That looks like the
continental breakfast at a OK 8.

00:14:05.467 --> 00:14:06.934
[ Laughter ]

00:14:06.934 --> 00:14:09.000
I bet you all
the little mini cereal boxes

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.467
are weird brand name knockoffs

00:14:10.467 --> 00:14:13.567
like Frosted Fakes
or Honey Nut Cheeri-No's.

00:14:13.567 --> 00:14:15.267
But the frustrating part
of this investigation

00:14:15.267 --> 00:14:17.934
is that we've known
some of these details for years.

00:14:17.934 --> 00:14:19.834
There have been bombshell
reports in the New York Times

00:14:19.834 --> 00:14:21.601
and other places about
all kinds of seemingly,

00:14:21.601 --> 00:14:23.801
fraudulent activity
and Trump's former fixer,

00:14:23.801 --> 00:14:26.467
Michael Cohen, explained
to Congress under oath

00:14:26.467 --> 00:14:28.400
the kinds of details
we're hearing now.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.701
-To your knowledge,
did the president

00:14:29.701 --> 00:14:34.267
ever provide inflated assets
to an insurance company?

00:14:34.267 --> 00:14:35.901
-Yes.

00:14:35.901 --> 00:14:38.434
-Who else knows
that the president did this?

00:14:38.434 --> 00:14:40.601
-Allen Weisselberg,
Ron Lieberman

00:14:40.601 --> 00:14:42.334
and Matthew Calamari.

00:14:42.334 --> 00:14:44.133
-To your knowledge,
was the president interested

00:14:44.133 --> 00:14:47.300
in reducing his local
real estate bills, tax bills?

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:50.067
-Yes.
-And how did he do that?

00:14:50.067 --> 00:14:52.968
-What you do is you deflate
the value of the asset

00:14:52.968 --> 00:14:57.133
and then you put in a request
to the tax department

00:14:57.133 --> 00:14:59.367
for a deduction.

00:14:59.367 --> 00:15:01.567
-How is it that Congress can get
the president's lawyer

00:15:01.567 --> 00:15:03.467
to say under oath
that he committed fraud

00:15:03.467 --> 00:15:04.968
and it takes years
before someone

00:15:04.968 --> 00:15:07.300
in law enforcement is like,
hey, we think this guy

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.901
might have committed fraud.

00:15:08.901 --> 00:15:11.167
It's like one of those crime
shows where it takes 10 episodes

00:15:11.167 --> 00:15:12.734
for everyone around
the charming British guy

00:15:12.734 --> 00:15:14.300
with a mysterious past to say,

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:17.100
huh, do you think maybe
he murdered his secret mistress

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:18.868
who is with the night
of the murder?

00:15:18.868 --> 00:15:20.767
Because let me
give you a hint, detective.

00:15:20.767 --> 00:15:24.367
If it's modern day Hugh Grant,
he is the killer.

00:15:24.367 --> 00:15:26.467
This ain't your romcom
Hugh Grant anymore.

00:15:26.467 --> 00:15:28.767
He's the bad boy now,
and I, for one, am here for it.

00:15:28.767 --> 00:15:30.934
This is the golden age
of Hugh Grant.

00:15:30.934 --> 00:15:33.868
The stammer is gone,
and in its place are the cold,

00:15:33.868 --> 00:15:35.801
dead eyes of a killer.

00:15:35.801 --> 00:15:37.267
If they remade
"Notting Hill" now,

00:15:37.267 --> 00:15:38.601
Julia Roberts
will be missing

00:15:38.601 --> 00:15:42.033
and the Bookshop Strangler
would be the only suspect.

00:15:42.033 --> 00:15:44.534
They should remake
all of his old movies.

00:15:44.534 --> 00:15:47.367
One ticket to "Four Funerals
and a Wedding," please.

00:15:47.367 --> 00:15:50.133
[ Laughter ]

00:15:50.133 --> 00:15:52.434
It's so obvious it's Hugh Grant.

00:15:52.434 --> 00:15:53.834
[ Laughter ]

00:15:53.834 --> 00:15:56.167
It's so --
you know obviously it is?

00:15:56.167 --> 00:15:59.000
This is how I react when I hear
Hugh Grant is the killer.

00:16:00.367 --> 00:16:03.467
[ Laughter ]

00:16:03.467 --> 00:16:05.901
[ Applause ]

00:16:05.901 --> 00:16:08.567
These guys have been committing
their crimes in broad daylight,

00:16:08.567 --> 00:16:09.834
and the integrity of our system

00:16:09.834 --> 00:16:11.167
relies on holding them
accountable.

00:16:11.167 --> 00:16:13.868
Trump and Rudy have exploited
that system for years,

00:16:13.868 --> 00:16:15.868
but we have as much evidence
of their guilt in front of us

00:16:15.868 --> 00:16:16.968
as we could possibly need.

00:16:16.968 --> 00:16:18.000
I don't know what will happen,

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.167
but I'm guessing
if the feds ever knock on

00:16:20.167 --> 00:16:21.667
Rudy's door to arrest him,
he'll say,

00:16:21.667 --> 00:16:23.033
No, I'm not Rudy Giuliani.

00:16:23.033 --> 00:16:25.367
-I'm Spartacus.

00:16:25.367 --> 00:16:26.734
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:16:26.734 --> 00:16:30.634
♪♪

